      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Contribution to the 'Sheer-Trouble: A Double Trouble Erotic Zine' from last year. Glimmer exits the scene, lending her two submissive girlfriends to Double Trouble for a scene of threesome play. In the shower, the reptilian dominant is all a flutter with ecstasy over the sexy session in store for them, using the full measure of their tail to hastily get off. And later, the shapeshifter uses their powers to really give Catra and Adora a session they'll both neither forget. They even have a cock for each of the two submissives...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
